[
    {
        "id": "tblive-tab",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "TB Live parser",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "# TB Live parser examples\n\nEvery inject on the left feeds the **TB Live** node. Its output is split three ways:\n\n- **CLEAN** — sentences with no `errors`\n- **FLAGGED** — sentences carrying `errors`, including *garbage* ones (`id: \"unknown\"`)\n- **RESPONSES** — answers to `memory` / `firmware` / `ids` / `definition` / `fake`\n\nSentence payloads are the datasheets' own examples (receiver-1.0.1.pdf).\n"
    },
